Resource    taf/rfrl/procedures/resources/robot/Counters.robot

Library     OperatingSystem
Library     taf.rfrl.procedures.resources.python.simulator.airphone.Airphone  WITH NAME  simulator

*** Keywords ***

CB006449_DC_IWK4_Interworking_with_CB010701_Inter_band_FDD_TDD_FR1_UL_CA_2CCs_with_3Tx
    [Documentation]  This test case describes the steps needed to verify interworking with CB010701.
    ...              CB010701 extends FR1 TDD + FDD UL CA so that UL MIMO can be used in TDD carrier, achieving better throughput for UL CA.
    ...              In this scenario a further FR1 TDD cell is added as a candidate for UL CA to verify that the algorithm still selects the best option between T + F UL CA, T+T UL CA  or  UL MIMO on TDD Cell.
    ...              UEs, which are capable of 3Tx transmission and within gNB configured bands have band combination with 1 layer UL for FDD band and 2 layer UL for TDD band,
    ...              shall be connected to the TDD FR1 cell as PCell  to support 2 layer UL transmission and FDD cell as DL and UL SCell to support 1 layer UL transmission.
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              expected_throughputs (dict):   dict with expected throughput (in Mbps) and deviation (in %) values
    ...                                             for each cell identified by its index, e.g.:
    ...              !!!IMPORTANT!!! Maximum throughput value per cell that can be set is 175 Mbps.
    ...                              {
    ...                                'CellIndex-0':
    ...                                {
    ...                                    'throughput':
    ...                                    {
    ...                                        'uplink': 10,
    ...                                        'downlink': 20
    ...                                    },
    ...                                    'deviation': 5
    ...                                },
    ...                                'CellIndex-1':
    ...                                {
    ...                                    'throughput':
    ...                                    {
    ...                                        'uplink': 15.5,
    ...                                        'downlink': 25
    ...                                    },
    ...                                    'deviation': 10.5
    ...                                },
    ...                             }
    ...              ue_capability_file (str):  Path to the UE capability file to be used for the test.

    [Arguments]      ${throughputs}
    ...              ${ue_capability_file}
    [Timeout]        24 hours

    ${ue_capability_file}=                                   Copy File    ${ue_capability_file}  /tmp/ue_capability_file.cfg
    simulator.setup_custom_ue_radio_capabilities             ue_id=1
    ...                                                      ue_nr_capabilities=UE_UL_CA_CAPA_M80 capability_file=${ue_capability_file}
    ${counter_list}=                                         Create List    M55165C00039
    Attach UE to the TDD FR1 cell0
    Increase PCell Quality Above Threshold
    ${dl_trf_ids}  ${ul_trf_ids}                             CB006449_DC Initiate Data Transmission
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    Wait For New Counters Data Frame Generation              data_frame_interval=5min
    ${counter_value}=                                        Wait for End of Current Counters Frame and Collect Counters
    ...                                                      data_frame_interval=5min
    ...                                                      counter_ids=${counter_list}
    ...                                                      component_name=NRCELL-1
    ${dl_tput_report}  ${ul_tput_report}                     CB006449_DC Get Data Transfer Reports
    CB006449_DC Stop Data Transmission                       dl_trf_ids=${dl_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      ul_trf_ids=${ul_trf_ids}
    CB006449_DC Verify Data Transmission And Counter Results             
    ...                                                      counter_value=${counter_value}
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                      dl_tput_report=${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      ul_tput_report=${ul_tput_report}

Attach UE to the TDD FR1 cell0
    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Attaching UE to the TDD FR1 cell0
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd                              cmd=set_pdu_param ue=1 pdu=1 trf_type=internal
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_register id=1
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=Received REGISTRATION COMPLETE from UE
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_pdu_session_setup pdu=1 ue=1 nwslice=1 gw=1
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=UE-1 PDU SESSION ID-1 setup/reestablishment complete
    
    Robot Log Result                                         msg=UE attached to the TDD FR1 cell0 successfully!

Increase PCell Quality Above Threshold
    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Increasing PCell quality above threshold
    
    simulator.execute_egate_cmd_and_wait_for_data            cmd=ue_measurement_send_nr id=1 event=A1 meas_id=3 srsrp_nr=58 srsrq_nr=1 phycell_id=51 nrsrp_nr=57 nrsrq_nr=122
    ...                                                      pass_regexp=SCellIndex 2 activated successfully at airphone
    
    Robot Log Result                                         msg=PCell quality increased above threshold successfully!
    
CB006449_DC Initiate Data Transmission
    [Arguments]                                              ${throughputs}
    ${trf_id}=                                               Set Variable    1
    ${dl_trf_ids}=                                           Create List
    ${ul_trf_ids}=                                           Create List

    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Initiating data transmission...
    FOR  ${cell_data}  IN  @{throughputs.values()}
        TRY
            simulator.start_downlink_data_transfer           ue_id=1
            ...                                              pdu_id=1
            ...                                              qfi_id=1
            ...                                              trf_id=${trf_id}
            ...                                              protocol=udp
            ...                                              throughput=${cell_data['throughput']['downlink']}
            Append To List                                   ${dl_trf_ids}
            ...                                              ${trf_id}
            ${trf_id}=                                       Evaluate    ${trf_id} + 1
        EXCEPT  *KeyError: 'downlink'*    type=GLOB
            No Operation
        END
        TRY
            simulator.start_uplink_data_transfer             ue_id=1
            ...                                              pdu_id=1
            ...                                              qfi_id=1
            ...                                              trf_id=${trf_id}
            ...                                              protocol=udp
            ...                                              throughput=${cell_data['throughput']['uplink']}
            Append To List                                   ${ul_trf_ids}
            ...                                              ${trf_id}
            ${trf_id}=                                       Evaluate    ${trf_id} + 1
        EXCEPT  *KeyError: 'uplink'*    type=GLOB
            No Operation
        END
    END

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=Data transmission initiated successfully!\nDownlink transfer IDs: ${dl_trf_ids}.\nUplink transfer IDs: ${ul_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      to_console=${True}
    [Return]                                                 ${dl_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      ${ul_trf_ids}


CB006449_DC Stop Data Transmission
    [Arguments]                                              ${dl_trf_ids}
    ...                                                      ${ul_trf_ids}

    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Stopping data transmission...
    FOR  ${trf_id}  IN  @{dl_trf_ids}
        simulator.stop_downlink_data_transfer                ue_id=1
        ...                                                  pdu_id=1
        ...                                                  qfi_id=1
        ...                                                  trf_id=${trf_id}
    END
    FOR  ${trf_id}  IN  @{ul_trf_ids}
        simulator.stop_uplink_data_transfer                  ue_id=1
        ...                                                  pdu_id=1
        ...                                                  qfi_id=1
        ...                                                  trf_id=${trf_id}
    END

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=Data transmission stopped successfully!

CB006449_DC Get Data Transfer Reports
    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Getting data transfer reports...
    ${dl_tput_report}=                                       simulator.get_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      ue_id=1
    ...                                                      scell=0-2
    ...                                                      stat_type=pdsch
    ${ul_tput_report}=                                       simulator.get_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      ue_id=1
    ...                                                      scell=0-2
    ...                                                      stat_type=pusch

    Robot Log Result                                         msg=Data transfer reports received successfully!
    [Return]                                                 ${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      ${ul_tput_report}


CB006449_DC Verify Data Transmission And Counter Results
    [Arguments]                                              ${counter_value}
    ...                                                      ${throughputs}
    ...                                                      ${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      ${ul_tput_report}

    Robot Log Operation                                      msg=Verifying data transmission and counter results...
    ${dl_status}    ${dl_msg}=                               Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      simulator.verify_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      transfer_data=${dl_tput_report}
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                      verify_total_avg_tput=True
    ...                                                      total_avg_deviation=5
    ${ul_status}    ${ul_msg}=                               Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      simulator.verify_data_transfer_results
    ...                                                      transfer_data=${ul_tput_report}
    ...                                                      throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                      verify_total_avg_tput=True
    ...                                                      total_avg_deviation=5
    ${counter_status}    ${counter_msg}=                     Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                                      Should Be Equal As Numbers
    ...                                                      ${counter_value[0]['NRCELL-1/NRUC/M55165C00039'][0]}  300.0
    ...                                                      msg=After full 5min data transfer cycle, counter M55165C00039 value for NRCELL-1 should be equal 300.0

    Run Keyword If                                           """${dl_status}""" != """PASS""" or """${ul_status}""" != """PASS""" or """${counter_status}""" != """PASS"""
    ...                                                      Fail
    ...                                                      msg=\n\n1. DL verification status: ${dl_status} - ${dl_msg}\n\n2. UL verification status: ${ul_status} - ${ul_msg}\n\n3. Counter verification status: ${counter_status} - ${counter_msg}
